WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.206
Meet Lucy. She is a beautiful caterpillar.

2
00:00:11.207 --> 00:00:14.050
One morning she saw Sally Spider.

3
00:00:14.051 --> 00:00:19.240
"Hi, Sally! What are you doing today?" asked Lucy.

4
00:00:19.241 --> 00:00:22.263
"I am spinning a web to catch some lunch.

5
00:00:22.264 --> 00:00:27.430
Do you want to spin a web with me?" Sally asked.

6
00:00:27.431 --> 00:00:30.113
"Oh, I'd like to spin with you.

7
00:00:30.114 --> 00:00:35.710
But I think I have too many legs!" said Lucy.

8
00:00:35.711 --> 00:00:40.438
"That's true. I only have eight legs," said Sally.

9
00:00:40.439 --> 00:00:44.098
"But you have sixteen! Wow."

10
00:00:44.099 --> 00:00:51.722
Lucy laughed and said, "Yeah, they help me hold on to branches better."

11
00:00:51.723 --> 00:00:55.074
"I've got to keep spinning," said Sally.

12
00:00:55.075 --> 00:00:57.888
"See you later, Lucy!"

13
00:00:57.889 --> 00:01:00.539
Lucy said good-bye.

14
00:01:00.540 --> 00:01:03.154
Then she met Anthony Ant.

15
00:01:03.155 --> 00:01:08.471
"Hi, Anthony! What are you doing today?" she asked.

16
00:01:08.472 --> 00:01:11.239
"I'm carrying food back to my house.

17
00:01:11.240 --> 00:01:15.624
I will save it until winter," Anthony said.

18
00:01:15.625 --> 00:01:17.805
Lucy was very impressed.

19
00:01:17.806 --> 00:01:20.100
"I save my food too.

20
00:01:20.101 --> 00:01:23.972
But I save it inside my body."

21
00:01:23.973 --> 00:01:29.004
"That's very smart!" Anthony said.

22
00:01:29.005 --> 00:01:34.300
"Hi, Lucy!" said a bee, drinking from a daisy.

23
00:01:34.301 --> 00:01:39.242
"Hi, Bert! What are you doing today?" Lucy asked.

24
00:01:39.243 --> 00:01:42.264
"I'm collecting pollen to share with the queen bee.

25
00:01:42.265 --> 00:01:46.333
Do you want some?" Bert asked.

26
00:01:46.334 --> 00:01:49.619
"No, thank you. I ate my lunch already.

27
00:01:49.620 --> 00:01:51.514
Look at these leaves!

28
00:01:51.515 --> 00:01:56.103
Aren't they delicious?" asked Lucy.

29
00:01:56.104 --> 00:01:58.747
"Uh, sure! But I'd rather eat honey.

30
00:01:58.748 --> 00:02:00.699
See you tomorrow, Lucy!"

31
00:02:00.700 --> 00:02:06.205
And Bert flew off to a flower far away.

32
00:02:06.206 --> 00:02:09.367
Can you guess Lucy's favorite hobby?

33
00:02:09.368 --> 00:02:11.739
That's right, it's eating!

34
00:02:11.740 --> 00:02:19.522
She needs to eat a lot of leaves because she stores her food in her body.

35
00:02:19.523 --> 00:02:22.393
"I ate so many leaves today!

36
00:02:22.394 --> 00:02:28.011
Maybe I will go someplace quiet and take a nap," thought Lucy.

37
00:02:28.012 --> 00:02:31.690
"Oh, and sleeping upside down sounds comfortable.

38
00:02:31.691 --> 00:02:38.495
I'm sleepy." Lucy started to snore.

39
00:02:38.496 --> 00:02:44.759
Lucy is sleepy because she is about to make a big change!

40
00:02:44.760 --> 00:02:53.145
After eating many leaves for many months, she will shed her caterpillar skin and form a hard shell called a chrysalis.

41
00:02:53.146 --> 00:02:57.415
Inside her chrysalis, she will sleep for a long time.

42
00:02:57.416 --> 00:03:01.224
Can you guess what happens next?

43
00:03:01.225 --> 00:03:07.091
"Hey, Sally. Have you seen Lucy lately?" asked Anthony.

44
00:03:07.092 --> 00:03:13.967
"No, Anthony. I haven't seen Lucy for two weeks!" Sally said.

45
00:03:13.968 --> 00:03:16.742
"Bert, have you seen Lucy?"

46
00:03:16.743 --> 00:03:19.764
"No, Sally. I haven't seen her either."

47
00:03:19.765 --> 00:03:25.385
Bert was very worried.

48
00:03:25.386 --> 00:03:28.039
"I think we should go look for her.

49
00:03:28.040 --> 00:03:32.573
Do you want to come with me?" Anthony asked.

50
00:03:32.574 --> 00:03:35.643
"Yes!" said Bert and Sally.

51
00:03:35.644 --> 00:03:38.659
They flew and crawled after him.

52
00:03:38.660 --> 00:03:43.912
"Look, Anthony! There are Lucy's clothes!" cried Sally.

53
00:03:43.913 --> 00:03:47.034
She pointed at Lucy's old skin.

54
00:03:47.035 --> 00:03:49.955
Bert looked at Lucy's hard shell.

55
00:03:49.956 --> 00:03:52.467
"Why, it must be an evil monster!

56
00:03:52.468 --> 00:03:54.531
I think it ate Lucy!"

57
00:03:54.532 --> 00:03:57.759
He knocked on the monster's shell.

58
00:03:57.760 --> 00:03:59.635
"Excuse me. Open up.

59
00:03:59.636 --> 00:04:02.798
Did you eat my friend, Lucy? Hello?"

60
00:04:02.799 --> 00:04:09.063
Suddenly the chrysalis opened.

61
00:04:09.064 --> 00:04:13.435
"Lucy?" asked all three friends, confused.

62
00:04:13.436 --> 00:04:17.112
"You're beautiful!" said Sally.

63
00:04:17.113 --> 00:04:23.808
"Thanks. So you like my new wings?" said Lucy, smiling.

64
00:04:23.809 --> 00:04:26.530
"I sure do!" said Bert.

65
00:04:26.531 --> 00:04:31.038
"Will you join me for some leaves and pollen?"

66
00:04:31.039 --> 00:04:38.705
"Sorry, Bert, but I have to fly across the field and lay over a hundred eggs!" said Lucy.

67
00:04:38.706 --> 00:04:40.966
"For once I'm not hungry!

68
00:04:40.967 --> 00:04:43.604
All I want to do is fly!"

69
00:04:43.605 --> 00:04:49.875
Lucy floated off into the distance, and her friends cheered.

70
00:04:49.876 --> 00:05:01.585
"Bye, Lucy! We'll miss you!"
